Output: 4. Capacity Development: Strengthened GPMO and MPMOs that are able to meet all the ADB requirements;
Strengthened capacity of the Project Cities to plan and implement an integrated and sustainable urban transport system. Indicator: About 20 decision makers and the concerned technical staff in GZARG and the Project Cities have been trained through especially designed training programs, with a target for 30% women professional participation. Progress/Status: To be assessed at PCR Data Source: Evaluation reports for the training programs Project progress reports Project completion report
