Output: 4. Capacity Development: Strengthened GPMO and MPMOs that are able to meet all the ADB requirements;
Strengthened capacity of the Project Cities to plan and implement an integrated and sustainable urban transport system. Indicator: GPMO and each MPMO appoint one gender focal point respectively to manage and coordinate GAP&apos;s work. Progress/Status: PMOs of Guangxi and project cities have assigned female coordinators, respectively, since the end of 2012 to coordinate implementation of gender action plan. Data Source: Project progress reports Project completion report
